        "history_tables": {
          "recording_versions": 404,
          "transcript_versions": 404,
          "recording_history": 404,
          "transcript_history": 404
        }
      },
      "findings": [
        "`recordings.updated_at` did not change when the transcript was rewritten \u2014 the column exists but nothing maintains it, so even 'when was this last edited' is not answerable from the row.",
        "the edit overwrites `recordings.transcript` in place. There is no version column and no history table (recording_versions=404, transcript_versions=404, recording_history=404, transcript_history=404). Undo/redo lives only in the browser's localStorage (`historyService.ts`, key `transcript_history_<id>`, capped at 50 states), so history is per-browser, invisible to anyone else, and lost on cache clear, a different device, or another user opening the same recording. WEB-005 asks for versioning of a saved transcript; the server keeps exactly one version."
      ]
    },
